<sync start=640><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>易考范文二</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　At first sight, the cartoon is not uncommon:</font>
<sync start=2710><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>易考范文二</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　At first sight, the cartoon is not uncommon:</font>
<sync start=8180><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>a man is spraying insecticide on a mass of pests</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　to prevent them from spreading diseases.</font>
<sync start=12010><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>a man is spraying insecticide on a mass of pests</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　to prevent them from spreading diseases.</font>
<sync start=14410><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>But on reflection,</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　we can realize it actually serves as an analogy to a phenomenon</font>
<sync start=16050><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>But on reflection,</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　we can realize it actually serves as an analogy to a phenomenon</font>
<sync start=20870><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>that has aroused our social concerns.</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　Like these pests, product safety, especially food safety,</font>
<sync start=23500><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>that has aroused our social concerns.</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　Like these pests, product safety, especially food safety,</font>
<sync start=28410><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>pose a grave threat to the public interest.</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　Now, some money-oriented businessmen resort to illegal means</font>
<sync start=31690><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>pose a grave threat to the public interest.</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　Now, some money-oriented businessmen resort to illegal means</font>
<sync start=37390><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>in order to extract more profits from consumers.</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　They betray their conscience by injecting water into pork,</font>
<sync start=40670><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>in order to extract more profits from consumers.</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　They betray their conscience by injecting water into pork,</font>
<sync start=45370><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>adding harmful substance to milk or applying too much agricultural chemical to crops.</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　Many consumers develop severe illnesses which result from eating  tainted food.</font>
<sync start=52040><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>adding harmful substance to milk or applying too much agricultural chemical to crops.</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　Many consumers develop severe illnesses which result from eating  tainted food.</font>
<sync start=58280><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>In light of the seriousness of the problem,</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　we must spare no effort to launch a campaign against this phenomenon.</font>
<sync start=61660><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>In light of the seriousness of the problem,</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　we must spare no effort to launch a campaign against this phenomenon.</font>
<sync start=66370><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>First of all, it is most important that a wide-ranging surveillance system be built</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　to guarantee the quality and safety of products.</font>
<sync start=71950><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>First of all, it is most important that a wide-ranging surveillance system be built</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　to guarantee the quality and safety of products.</font>
<sync start=75560><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>Moreover, laws and regulations concerned should be made</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　to punish the selfishness and irresponsibility.</font>
<sync start=80150><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>Moreover, laws and regulations concerned should be made</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　to punish the selfishness and irresponsibility.</font>
<sync start=83540><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>Last but not least, it is necessary for consumers to be well-informed of the potential harm</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　brought by certain problematic products.</font>
<sync start=90430><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>Last but not least, it is necessary for consumers to be well-informed of the potential harm</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　brought by certain problematic products.</font>
<sync start=93390><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>With our concerted efforts, I am convinced these “pests” will eventually go extinct.</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　</font>
